{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112813","id":3013453085,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6znaUd","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112813","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112813.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112813.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112813","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112813/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112813/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112813/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/06a7feabc82f4ea3cfe13cc61fa90f8fe9a8b603","number":112813,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix incorrect alignment padding calculation for PCK header in embedded export","user":{"login":"Yanxiyimengya","id":140093497,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFmoOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140093497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya","html_url":"https://github.com/Yanxiyimengya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixed #112812\r\n\r\nThe PCK header alignment padding calculation in EditorExportPlatform::save_pack() is incorrect.\r\n\r\nThe current code calculates the padding as position % 8, which is wrong. For example:\r\n\r\nIf position = 10, then 10 % 8 = 2\r\nThe code fills 2 bytes, making position = 12\r\nBut 12 is not aligned to 8 bytes)\r\nThe correct padding should be (8 - (position % 8)) % 8, which would fill 6 bytes to reach position 16.\r\n\r\nThis bug causes embedded PCK header to potentially start at misaligned positions.\r\n\r\nIn fact, we should use the _get_pad function to calculate the alignment bytes.\r\n`\r\nint pad = _get_pad(8, f->get_position());\r\nfor (int i = 0; i < pad; i++) {\r\n\tf->store_8(0);\r\n}\r\n`\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","sta